===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chiefly|US}} A person, usually an attractive female, who [[encourage]]s [[applause]] and [[cheer]]s at a [[sport]]s [[event]], and wearing specially-designed [[uniform]]s in the official colors of the team he/she cheers for.
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} A person who rallies support for any cause.

